      "title": "ElizaOS Community Discussion - July 5, 2026",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Community members discussed the current state of ElizaOS and its organizational structure. A user asked whether ElizaOS is SOC 2 Type II certified and ready for enterprise use. Odilitime confirmed that ElizaCloud uses SOC 2 Type II certified providers. Separately, questions arose about the status of the ElizaOS team and its reduced activity on social media. Odilitime clarified that ElizaOS Labs was dissolved in April, but the foundation remains active and open source contributors continue to help. When asked whether the dissolution of Labs impacts ElizaCloud delivery, Odilitime stated that work on ElizaCloud is ongoing and progressing well. A community member also noted that the AI-ElizaOS-Updates channel has not been updated in a long time and requested someone address it. Another user suggested checking GitHub to see active contributors.",
